# App Store screenshot profile output — regenerable release-candidate PNGs,
# unlike the committed design/screens/ handoff set. See `npm run shots:store`.
design/store/

# Google Play listing assets — phone screenshots (`npm run shots:play`) plus
# the app icon export and feature graphic (`npm run gen:play-assets`). Same
# reasoning as design/store/ above: regenerable release artefacts, not part
# of the design/screens/ handoff set.
design/play/

